<h1>Products</h1>

<p>Tools and configurations we use in client work and release publicly. Each is tested in production environments before publication.</p>

<div class="card-grid">
  {%- for product in products %}
  <div class="product-card">
    <span class="status-badge{% if product.status == 'Private beta' %} status-badge--beta{% elif product.status == 'Research' %} status-badge--research{% endif %}">{{ product.status }}</span>
    <h3>{{ product.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ product.outcome }}</p>
    <p class="product-audience">{{ product.audience }}</p>
    {% if product.url != "TODO" %}
    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="card-link">{{ product.cta }} &rarr;</a>
    {% else %}
    <!-- TODO: Wire product URL once repo locations are confirmed -->
    <span class="card-link" style="opacity:0.4">URL pending</span>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>

<hr>

<p>All products are open source unless marked otherwise. If you use something and find an issue, open a pull request or <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">let us know</a>.</p>
